  "question": {
    "text": "Match the polymers in <strong>column-A</strong> with their main uses in <strong>column-B</strong> and choose the correct answer:<br />\r&nbsp;\r<table border=\"1\">\r\t<tbody>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>Column - A</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>Column - B</strong></td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Polystyrene</td>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>i.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Paints and lacquers</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Glyptal</td>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>ii.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Rain coats</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Polyvinyl chloride&nbsp;</td>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>iii.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Manufacture of toys</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Bakelite</td>\r\t\t\t<td><strong>iv.</strong></td>\r\t\t\t<td>Computer discs</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</tbody>\r</table>\r",
