  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Polystyrene is a synthetic aromatic hydrocarbon polymer.Polystyrene is clear, hard, and rather brittle.<br />Glyptal is a polyester obtained by condensation polymerization of glycerol and phthalic anhydride.<br />Bakelite is electrical nonconductivity and heat-resistant.<br />Polyvinyl Chloride is a high strength thermoplastic material.</p><p>The correct order is<br />&nbsp;​</p><table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Column - A</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Column - B</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Polystyrene</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>iii.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Manufacture of toys</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Glyptal</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>i.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Paints and lacquers</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Polyvinyl chloride chloride</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>ii.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Raincoats</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Bakelite</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>iv.</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>Computer discs</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
